  * outputs are persistent buffers: capture NL.build(static_pos) inside the step graph; read overflow/n_edges after
    replay (one D2H of 2 ints when the caller decides to check).
  * open systems: cell/rcell/volume change per step and are produced on device by the builder (out["cell"] etc.).
